# Activity Widget — 5 design directions

Data per event (`FeedItem`): `occurredAt`, `actor` (member|sys), `eventType`, `subjectKind` (instance/note/task/attachment/concept), `subjectId`, `payload`, `previous`. Helpers give `eventLabel` (verb), `eventSnippet` (≤80c), `eventDetails` (diff rows). Instance events click → `/instances/:id`.

Today shipped: `timeline` (avatar rail) + `log` (dense table), auto-picked by width. Below = 5 alternative directions, not cosmetic tweaks.

---

## 1 — Timeline rail (narrow / story)

Vertical connector, avatar nodes, verb + snippet stacked. Best in a tall narrow column.

```
┌─ Activity ─────────────────────────┐
│                                     │
│  (JS)──● Jane Smith        · 5m     │
│   │     edited fields               │
│   │     Name, Status                │
│   │                                 │
│  (JD)──● John Doe          · 2h     │
│   │     added a note                │
│   │     "Quick check on the Q3…"    │
│   │                                 │
│  (sy)──● system            · 3h     │
│   │     synced 12 Linear issues     │
│   │                                 │
│  (MK)──● Maya K.           · 1d     │
│         status  Open → In Progress  │
│                                     │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 2 — Dense log table (wide / scan)

Fixed columns, one line per event, snippet truncated. Best in a wide tile — maximize events per pixel.

```
┌─ Activity ──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ WHEN  WHO          DID            WHAT                        │
│ ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│  5m   Jane Smith   edited         Name, Status                │
│  2h   John Doe     + note         "Quick check on the Q3…"    │
│  3h   system       synced         12 Linear issues            │
│  1d   Maya K.      status →       Open → In Progress          │
│  1d   Jane Smith   assigned       jane@ → john@               │
│  2d   system       + attachment   contract-v3.pdf             │
│  2d   John Doe     created        Acme Corp                   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 3 — Grouped digest (day buckets)

Events bucketed under Today / Yesterday / date headers; collapsible. Best for catching up over days, not minutes.

```
┌─ Activity ─────────────────────────────────┐
│ ▼ TODAY                            6 events │
│    5m · Jane edited Name, Status            │
│    2h · John added a note                   │
│    3h · system synced 12 Linear issues      │
│                                             │
│ ▼ YESTERDAY                        9 events │
│    Maya moved 3 tasks → In Progress         │
│    Jane assigned 2 items to John            │
│                                             │
│ ▶ JUN 14                          14 events │
│ ▶ JUN 13                           3 events │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 4 — Diff cards (before → after focus)

Each event is a card; field edits render the actual prev→next diff inline, not just field names. Best for audit / "what exactly changed".

```
┌─ Activity ──────────────────────────────────┐
│ ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐│
│ │ (JS) Jane Smith · edited Acme Corp   5m  ││
│ │  Stage     Lead      →   Negotiation     ││
│ │  Owner     —         →   John Doe        ││
│ │  Value     $40,000   →   $52,000         ││
│ └──────────────────────────────────────────┘│
│ ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐│
│ │ (JD) John Doe · added a note     2h      ││
│ │  "Quick check on the Q3 renewal — they   ││
│ │   want to revisit seat count before…"    ││
│ └──────────────────────────────────────────┘│
│ ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐│
│ │ (sy) system · task status        3h      ││
│ │  Open ───────────────────► In Progress   ││
│ └──────────────────────────────────────────┘│
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

