## 5 — Pulse / heatmap (aggregate, not feed)

Not a raw list — a rollup: contribution heatmap by day, top actors, event-type mix. Best as a small "is this area alive?" health tile.

```
┌─ Activity · last 4 weeks ───────────────────┐
│  M T W T F S S                               │
│  ▢ ▤ ▦ ▩ ▣ ▢ ▢   ▩ heavy  ▦ med  ▤ light    │
│  ▤ ▩ ▣ ▣ ▦ ▢ ▢                               │
│  ▦ ▣ ▩ ▩ ▣ ▤ ▢      218 events ▲ 23% vs prev │
│  ▣ ▩ ▣ ▦ ▤ ▢ ▢                               │
│ ───────────────────────────────────────────  │
│  Top actors          Event mix               │
│   Jane   ████████ 64   edits      ███████ 41%│
│   John   █████ 38       notes      ████ 22%  │
│   Maya   ███ 21         tasks      ███ 19%   │
│   system █████████ 95   syncs      ███ 18%   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

