## Compare

| # | Direction      | Density | Strength                      | Reuses today's |
|---|----------------|---------|-------------------------------|----------------|
| 1 | Timeline rail  | low     | narrative, narrow columns     | ✅ ships now    |
| 2 | Dense log      | high    | scan many events fast         | ✅ ships now    |
| 3 | Grouped digest | med     | multi-day catch-up            | snippet only   |
| 4 | Diff cards     | low     | audit, real before→after      | `eventDetails` |
| 5 | Pulse/heatmap  | n/a     | health-at-a-glance, analytics | new agg query  |

## Build forks
- 1+2 already exist — want NEW variants (3/4/5) added, or these as redesigns of existing?
- 5 needs a server-side aggregate (counts/day, by-actor, by-type) — others are client-side over existing `listEvents`. OK to add an RPC?
- 4 diff-cards need value resolvers for non-text fields (enum/user/money/relation) — reuse `eventDetails` per-kind rendering?
- Add as new `variant` values on the one `activity` widget, or split into separate widget types?
